{
  "title": "ISic000080. Funerary inscription for an Abbot (?)",
  "body": "<div id=\"editions\"><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"la\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <a id=\"al1-interpretive\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-text=\"Hic\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Hic\">[Hic]</span>  <span data-text=\"requiescit\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"requiesco\">[requies]ciṭ</span>  <br id=\"al2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-text=\"in\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"in\">[in]</span>  <span data-text=\"pace\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"pax\">[pace]</span>  <span data-text=\"famulus\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"famulus\">[fam]ulus</span>  <span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Dei\"><span data-text=\"Dei\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"Deus\"><span class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">D(e)i</span></span></span>  <br id=\"al3-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>  <span data-text=\"abbas\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"abbas\">a]bba[s]</span>  <br id=\"al4-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span><span data-text=\"qui\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"qui\">[qui]</span>  <span data-text=\"vixit\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"vivo\">[vixit]</span>  <span data-text=\"annos\" data-n=\"55\" data-lemma=\"annus\">[an(nos)]</span>  <span data-text=\"plus\" data-n=\"60\" data-lemma=\"multus\"><span class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">p̣ḷ</span>(us)</span>  <span data-text=\"minus\" data-n=\"65\" data-lemma=\"paruus\">[m(inus)</span>  <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Robert Crellin</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive-simple-lemmatized\">  <div class=\"textpart\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <span data-text=\"Hic\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Hic\">Hic</span>  <span data-text=\"requiescit\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"requiesco\">requiescit</span>  <span data-text=\"in\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"in\">in</span>  <span data-text=\"pace\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"pax\">pace</span>  <span data-text=\"famulus\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"famulus\">famulus</span>  <span data-text=\"Dei\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"Deus\">Dei</span> [<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] <span data-text=\"abbas\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"abbas\">abbas</span>  <span data-text=\"qui\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"qui\">qui</span>  <span data-text=\"vixit\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"vivo\">vixit</span>  <span data-text=\"annos\" data-n=\"55\" data-lemma=\"annus\">annos</span>  <span data-text=\"plus\" data-n=\"60\" data-lemma=\"multus\">plus</span>  <span data-text=\"minus\" data-n=\"65\" data-lemma=\"paruus\">minus</span> [<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"la\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-text=\"Hic\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Hic\">[...</span><span data-text=\"requiescit\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"requiesco\">.......]CI.</span><br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-text=\"in\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"in\">[..</span><span data-text=\"pace\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"pax\">....</span><span data-text=\"famulus\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"famulus\">...]ULUS</span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Dei\"><span data-text=\"Dei\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"Deus\"><span class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">DI</span></span></span><br id=\"al3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span><span data-text=\"abbas\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"abbas\">.]BBA[.]</span><br id=\"al4-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span><span data-text=\"qui\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"qui\">[...</span><span data-text=\"vixit\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"vivo\">.....</span><span data-text=\"annos\" data-n=\"55\" data-lemma=\"annus\">...]</span><span data-text=\"plus\" data-n=\"60\" data-lemma=\"multus\"><span class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">..</span></span><span data-text=\"minus\" data-n=\"65\" data-lemma=\"paruus\">[..</span><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]</span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Robert Crellin</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic-simple-lemmatized\"><div class=\"textpart\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><span data-text=\"Hic\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Hic\">HIC</span><span data-text=\"requiescit\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"requiesco\">REQUIESCIT</span><span data-text=\"in\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"in\">IN</span><span data-text=\"pace\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"pax\">PACE</span><span data-text=\"famulus\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"famulus\">FAMULUS</span><span data-text=\"Dei\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"Deus\">DEI</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<span data-text=\"abbas\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"abbas\">ABBAS</span><span data-text=\"qui\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"qui\">QUI</span><span data-text=\"vixit\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"vivo\">VIXIT</span><span data-text=\"annos\" data-n=\"55\" data-lemma=\"annus\">ANNOS</span><span data-text=\"plus\" data-n=\"60\" data-lemma=\"multus\">PLUS</span><span data-text=\"minus\" data-n=\"65\" data-lemma=\"paruus\">MINUS</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]</span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2><a href=\"ISic000080_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"Photo courtesy Zurich Ietas excavations\" src=\"ISic000080_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic000080.jpg\"><img title=\"Photo courtesy Zurich Ietas excavations\" src=\"ISic000080-thumb.jpg\"></a></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span>  <span>Text of Rizzone 2009, with minor modification line 4 (after photo)</span>  </span>; </li><li><span class=\"line 1\">line.1: <span>Isler: CII; </span>  </span><br></li><li><span class=\"line 2\">line.2: <span>Isler: [Pa]ulus(?); Isler, Bivona: D(omin)i</span>  </span><br></li><li><span class=\"line 4\">line.4: <span>Isler: [---].I[---]; Rizzone [qui vixit an(nos)] pl(us) m(inus)[---]</span>  </span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"http://orcid.org/0000-0003-3819-8537\">Jonathan Prag</a></p>  <p>Here lies in peace the servant of God, Abbot [(name)], who lived [--] years, more or less</p>  </div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>Italian translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\">  </p><p>Qui giace in pace il servo di Dio [---] abate, che visse piu o meno anni [--]</p>  </div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>Rizzone 2009 reconstructs this as a rare record (for Sicily) of a member of a monastic order, in the context of discussing a funerary inscription from Mineo (<a href=\"http://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic003454\" target=\"_blank\">ISic003454</a>) which appears to record a monk.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> Isler 1994 30-31 fig.13 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001910\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001910</a>  </li><li> Bivona 1997-1998 613 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002144\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002144</a>  </li><li> Rizzone 2009 433 fig.4 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001634\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001634</a>  </li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"> Lines 1-4  40  Interlineation line 1 to 2    </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence </div>",
